Error [E0413]: `priv` only applies inside a `#PubFile` file
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_priv_without_marker.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | priv fn secret() => Int :: 0
    | ^^^^
 Why: without `#PubFile`, items are private by default and export with `pub`
 Fix: add `#PubFile` at the top of the file, or write `pub` instead of `priv`

Error [E0113]: `run` promises to return Unit ? Err, but this `return` is empty
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_priv_without_marker.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     return
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: the value handed back must match the type after `=>`
 Fix: add the value: `return ...;`
